<title>USA: NBA-ORDER OF SELECTION FOR WEDNESDAY NIGHT'S DRAFT.</title>
<headline>NBA-ORDER OF SELECTION FOR WEDNESDAY NIGHT'S DRAFT.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, North Carolina 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The</p>
<p>following is the order of selection for the first round of</p>
<p>Wednesday night's 1997 NBA Draft at the Charlotte Coliseum:</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>1. San Antonio</p>
<p>2. Philadelphia</p>
<p>3. Boston</p>
<p>4. Vancouver</p>
<p>5. Denver</p>
<p>6. Boston (from Dallas)</p>
<p>7. New Jersey</p>
<p>8. Golden State</p>
<p>9. Toronto</p>
<p>10. Milwaukee</p>
<p>11. Sacramento</p>
<p>12. Indiana</p>
<p>13. Cleveland</p>
<p>14. Los Angeles Clippers</p>
<p>15. Dallas (from Minnesota)</p>
<p>16. Cleveland (from Phoenix)</p>
<p>17. Orlando</p>
<p>18. Portland</p>
<p>19. Detroit</p>
<p>20. Minnesota (from Charlotte via Portland)</p>
<p>21. New Jersey (from LA Lakers)</p>
<p>22. Atlanta</p>
<p>23. Seattle</p>
<p>24. Houston</p>
<p>25. New York</p>
<p>26. Miami</p>
<p>27. Utah</p>
<p>28. Chicago</p>
</text>
